# Minotaur, Son of Minos

> Minotaur is the only roamer in MLBB whose kit gets more dangerous the harder the enemy team hits him. Once Minoan Fury activates his enraged state, his stomp covers more ground, his Motivation Roar heals every nearby teammate simultaneously, and the passive's damage-taken HP recovery runs at double rate. The gap between his normal and enraged state is the whole game.

